          "title": "OpenAI 部署了 Control Room，能在 35 秒內停止研究模型的工作負載。 / OpenAI deploys Control Room to stop research model workloads in 35 seconds",
          "title_zh": "OpenAI 部署了 Control Room，能在 35 秒內停止研究模型的工作負載。",
          "title_en": "OpenAI deploys Control Room to stop research model workloads in 35 seconds",
          "title_original": "OpenAI deploys Control Room to stop research model workloads in 35 seconds",
          "summary": "The internal system puts authorization at the inference layer, fails closed if disabled, and follows the Hugging Face incident and expanded misalignment monitoring.",
